cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Moonbow or the label-only gold standard in this repository,
  please cite the project. A BibTeX entry is provided in CITATION.bib.
title: Moonbow (月虹): In-Harness NLP Stream Pipelines of Narrow-Band Micro-Models for Agent Metacognition
abstract: >-
  Moonbow treats an agent's output as a continuous natural-language stream and
  adjudicates metacognitive questions with a cascade of a quantitative capture
  model and a qualitative adoption model composed by a deterministic state
  machine. The repository ships the Progress Guard closure gate as the first
  production plugin, together with a label-only gold standard for
  obligation-closure judgment and an honest negative-result study on
  small-model single-utterance closure classification (see limitations.md).
authors:
  - name: Nuctori
year: 2026
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/Nuctori/spark-4b"
type: software
